  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组添加了水坑，会在雨天生成，并使雪层在暴风雪中堆积。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">水坑是一种新方块，手持空瓶与之交互可将瓶子装满水。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模组灵感来源于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puddles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Puddles</a>。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/QHWqXv6/puddle-banner.png\" width=\"768\" height=\"132\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/351/937/2021-03-13_11.png\" width=\"655\" height=\"368\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yphNcXz/fabric-only-banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"586\" height=\"56\"></p>",
